@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K53
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
;経験の変更は齟齬が出る場合がありますので、CSVを修正し同梱する事を推奨します
CALL K53_CONFIGURE
CFLAG:53:K53C_INITIAL_VIRGIN = THINKS_IS_VIRGIN(53)
CFLAG:53:K53C_DAY_FIRST_MET = DAY
TALENT:53:初潮 = 1
PRINTL
IF !FLAG:なりきり
	;竹林で出会ったが竹林が住まいではない
	IF MAIN_MAP != 4 && CFLAG:現在位置 >= 竹林入り口 && CFLAG:現在位置 <= 永遠亭奥ノ院

		PRINTFORMW 「The bamboo doesn't keep visitors away, does it?」
		PRINTFORMDW Looking back at the youthful voice, there is a smallish girl standing there.
		PRINTFORMDW White ears like a rabbit's stick out of the impressive girl's short black hair. 
		PRINTFORMDW She wears a pink one-piece, the hem of which flutters dangerously at times.
		PRINTL
		
	;竹林で出会い竹林が住まい
	ELSEIF MAIN_MAP == 4 && CFLAG:現在位置 >= 401 && CFLAG:現在位置 <= 465
		PRINTFORMW 「The bamboo doesn't keep visitors away, does it?」
		PRINTFORMDW Looking back at the youthful voice, there is a smallish girl standing there.
		PRINTFORMDW White ears like a rabbit's stick out of the impressive girl's short black hair.
		PRINTFORMDW She wears a pink one-piece, the hem of which flutters dangerously at times.
		PRINTL 
		;永遠亭が住まい
		IF CFLAG:MASTER:初期位置 == 412 || CFLAG:MASTER:初期位置 == 428
			IF (TALENT:MASTER:動物耳 == 2) ;Bunny Ears.
				PRINTFORMW 「Are you a rabbit from outside? You came to stay at Eientei recently, didn't you?」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「You came to stay at Eientei recently, didn't you?」
			ENDIF
		;それ以外の場所が住まい
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「You came to this land recently, didn't you?」
		ENDIF
	;竹林以外で出会った
	ELSE
		IF !TALENT:MASTER:狐 || TALENT:MASTER:妖狐 || TALENT:MASTER:吸血鬼 || TALENT:MASTER:動物耳
			PRINTFORMW 「Hey, you. The rabbits have all been passing rumors about a strange human lately. Isn't that you?」
		ELSE
			IF TALENT:MASTER:動物耳 == 2 ;Bunny Ears.
				PRINTFORMW 「Hey, you. The rabbits have all been passing rumors about a strange rabbit lately. Isn't that you?」
			ELSEIF TALENT:MASTER:動物耳 == 3 ;Dog Ears.
				PRINTFORMW 「Hey, you. The rabbits have all been passing rumors about a strange dog lately. Isn't that you?」
			ELSEIF TALENT:MASTER:動物耳 == 4 ;Cat ears.
				PRINTFORMW 「Hey, you. The rabbits have all been passing rumors about a strange cat lately. Isn't that you?」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Hey, you. The rabbits have all been passing rumors about a strange youkai lately. Isn't that you?」
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMDW Looking back at the youthful voice, there is a smallish girl standing there.
		PRINTFORMDW White ears like a rabbit's stick out of the impressive girl's short black hair.
		PRINTFORMDW She wears a pink one-piece, the hem of which flutters dangerously at times.
		PRINTL
	ENDIF

	IF TALENT:MASTER:体型 == -2
		PRINTFORMW 「Aw, but you're just a little %PRINT_MALE("guy", MASTER)%, aren't ya?」
	ELSEIF TALENT:MASTER:体型 < -2
		PRINTFORMW 「You thought I couldn't see you because you're so small, right?」
	ELSEIF TALENT:MASTER:体型 > 1
		PRINTFORMW 「Kind of a big %PRINT_MALE("guy", MASTER)%, aren't ya?」
	ENDIF
	IF TALENT:ヤリマン
		PRINTFORMW 「Hmm-hmm...」
		PRINTFORMDW Her eyes trail back and forth along your body without shame, their expression turning a bit naughty.
	ENDIF
	IF TALENT:MASTER:動物耳 == 2 ;Bunny Ears.
		PRINTFORMW 「I'm Tewi Inaba. I'm the boss of the rabbits around here.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Hehe～ Don't worry, I won't order you around. Maybe～」
		PRINTFORMW 「Actually, I help sell medicine, too. Talk to me if you ever need any.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「I'm Tewi Inaba. I help sell medicine at Eientei. Talk to me if you ever need any.」
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMW 「Oh, and we've got lots of other services. Everything from cleaning to foraging materials!」
	IF TALENT:ヤリマン
		CALL PRINT_STRW, @"「Or, if you want some @ITALIC@other@ service―... You look cute enough～」"
	ENDIF

	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMW 「There is this thing, you'll have to keep it a secret but...」
	PRINTFORMDW Tewi brings her face close to yours and she whispers conspiratorially.
	PRINTFORMW 「So, I managed to get this thing going. One of those deals where you sell charms of fortune.」
	PRINTFORMDW Lowering her voice further, her breath tickles your ear a bit as she continues.
	PRINTFORMW 「How about it? If you hold one, fortune will certainly find you―.」
	PRINTFORMDW The innocent look on Tewi's face twists and warps as she tries peddling her wares to you...
ENDIF
CALL M_KOJO_DIARYSETTING_K53(8)
RETURN 1


