@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K53_1(ARG,ARG:1)
PRINTFORML 「Wait, we can't go home yet!」
PRINTFORMDW Tewi stops in her tracks as you're returning from the date.
PRINTFORMW 「There's something important we have to do! You know what that is?」
