	PRINTFORMDW While your attention was focused on the branch, she jumped up and stole a kiss!
ELSE
	PRINTFORMDW You can feel Tewi clinging to your upper body and see her eyes squeezed shut in front of your own.
	PRINTFORMDW While your attention was focused on the branch, she jumped up and stole a kiss!
ENDIF
